From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 11:21:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] backlight: ktz8869_iceland: give the second IC the values
 stock's kernel writes

The slave IC was programmed with BL_CFG2 = 0x8D and BL_OPTION2 = 0x77, the
values the bootloader leaves in it. Stock's kernel driver does not keep
those: when it first switches the backlight on it writes the same values
to both ICs (0x03 = 0xEB, 0x11 = 0x76), so under stock Android the slave
runs with the master's ramp setting and boost current limit.

Use the master's values for the slave as stock's kernel does: the slave's
current ramp setting and the register that holds its boost current limit
then are the ones stock runs with.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/video/backlight/ktz8869_iceland.c | 9 ++++++---
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8869_iceland.c b/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8869_iceland.c
index 16279b9ab486..f6dd2c61a676 100644
--- a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8869_iceland.c
+++ b/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8869_iceland.c
@@ -101,8 +101,11 @@ struct ktz8869_reg {
 };
 
 /*
- * Values the stock bootloader (ABL, 11.A.38) leaves in both ICs, read back on the tablet: the master drives
- * the LCD bias and half the LED strings, the slave the other strings with its own BL_CFG2/BL_OPTION2.
+ * The master drives the LCD bias and half the LED strings, the slave the other strings. The bias values and the
+ * master's backlight values are what the stock bootloader (ABL, 11.A.38) leaves in the IC, read back on the
+ * tablet, and what stock's kernel driver writes. ABL leaves the slave's BL_CFG2 / BL_OPTION2 at 0x8D / 0x77;
+ * stock's kernel writes the master's values to both ICs when it first switches the backlight on, so the slave
+ * gets those here too (BL_OPTION2 holds the boost converter's current limit).
  */
 static const struct ktz8869_reg ktz8869_bias_cfg[] = {
 	{ LCD_BOOST_CFG, 0x28 }, { OUTP_CFG, 0x1E }, { OUTN_CFG, 0x1E },
@@ -114,7 +117,7 @@ static const struct ktz8869_reg ktz8869_bl_cfg_master[] = {
 };
 
 static const struct ktz8869_reg ktz8869_bl_cfg_slave[] = {
-	{ BL_DIMMING, 0x44 }, { BL_CFG1, 0xB3 }, { BL_CFG2, 0x8D }, { BL_OPTION2, 0x77 },
+	{ BL_DIMMING, 0x44 }, { BL_CFG1, 0xB3 }, { BL_CFG2, 0xEB }, { BL_OPTION2, 0x76 },
 	{ PWM_RAMP_TIME, 0xF8 }, { BL_EN, 0x77 },
 };
 
